@host = https://localhost:7145

### Newest inspections first (default page 1, size 10)
GET {{host}}/api/inspections
Accept: application/json

### Combine filters; replace templateId with a real id
GET {{host}}/api/inspections?status=Draft&templateId=1&siteName=office&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### UTC range: inclusive start, exclusive end
GET {{host}}/api/inspections?startedFromUtc=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&startedToUtc=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Expected 400 with errors, traceId and instance
GET {{host}}/api/inspections?pageSize=101
Accept: application/json

### Expected 404 with traceId and instance
GET {{host}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### Expected 200 Healthy (process is running)
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Expected 200 Healthy when PostgreSQL is reachable, otherwise 503 Unhealthy
GET {{host}}/health/ready
